# Phase 14 - Beautiful Desktop Shell

Product shell (menu, dock, windows, settings) under the **Application & UI doctrine**:
**C = behavior**, **HTML/CSS = design**, **Roboticela React package = authoring + JS→C bridge**.
Visual density / materials / motion beyond foundation live in **Phases 44–47** — do not declare the Beautiful OS gate done until those are green.

**Execution order matters.** Finish **Track A (ASAP shell)** before Track B. Do not start Track B product surfaces until Track A boots a real desk on Host (and QEMU when guest-visible).

Foundations already landed outside this phase (do not rebuild): Phase **11.13** native shell paint, Phase **13.66–13.77** Input→Desktop (move/resize/focus/clipboard/cursor), Phase **15.19** compositor present, Phase **16** RoboJS + RoboDesktopScript, Phases **17–18** complete HTML/CSS, Phase **14.0** out-of-flow.

