## Phase 14 notes (agents)

- Prefer the next **unchecked Track A** goal over Track B or drive-by refactors.
- Growing bridge verbs is correct; inventing a second script engine or guest React is a defect.
- Phase **22** (RoboOS Native API) and Phase **28** (RoboAPI) **extend** DesktopBridge — they do not replace the ASAP shell pattern.
- Dock/menu/title bar = **C**. Settings/Finder content = **HTML/CSS**. User writes JS only through React package bridge helpers that call **C**.

