# Phase 44 - HiDPI / Retina Visual Density

Goal: screenshots and screen recordings look sharp on modern displays — logical UI × physical scale, never soft 1× upscales.
Applies to **C chrome and HTML/CSS content** alike; the React package authors in logical CSS `px`, C allocates physical framebuffers.

